{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshInApp"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshinapp\/gettingstarted"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshinapp\/gettingstarted"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Show native in-app messages and receive their callbacks."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Getting Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshInApp\/documentation\/PushwooshInApp\/Examples"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, ensure you have:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Pushwoosh account"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Pushwoosh project set up in your account"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An iOS platform configured in your Pushwoosh project"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your Pushwoosh Application Code from the Control Panel","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 15.0+ deployment target"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushwoosh SDK version 7.2.0 or higher"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PushwooshFramework, PushwooshCore, and PushwooshBridge frameworks integrated in your project","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Important"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Without PushwooshInApp linked, the SDK does not show native in-app messages: it logs "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"native in-app detected but PushwooshInApp module is not linked, skipping"},{"type":"text","text":" and drops the message."}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Step-1-Install-Module","text":"Step 1: Install Module"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Swift Package Manager","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, use the following URL to add the Pushwoosh dependency:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["https:\/\/github.com\/Pushwoosh\/Pushwoosh-XCFramework"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select the required modules in your target: PushwooshFramework, PushwooshCore, PushwooshBridge and PushwooshInApp."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"CocoaPods","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add to your Podfile:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"ruby","type":"codeListing","code":["pod 'PushwooshXCFramework'","pod 'PushwooshXCFramework\/PushwooshInApp'"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then run:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["pod install"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once the module is linked, in-app campaigns with native templates are shown automatically. No initialization call is required."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 2: Set the Delegate","anchor":"Step-2-Set-the-Delegate","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the delegate in "},{"code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to follow what happens to in-app messages:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import UIKit","import PushwooshFramework","import PushwooshInApp","","@main","class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate, PWInAppMessageDelegate {","","    func application(","        _ application: UIApplication,","        didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?","    ) -> Bool {","","        Pushwoosh.inApp.delegate = self","","        return true","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - PWInAppMessageDelegate","","    func pushwooshInAppDidPresent(messageId: String?) {","        print(\"In-app shown: \\(messageId ?? \"-\")\")","    }","","    func pushwooshInAppClickedAction(url: String, messageId: String?) {","        print(\"In-app link tapped: \\(url)\")","    }","","    func pushwooshInAppDidClose(messageId: String?) {","        print(\"In-app closed: \\(messageId ?? \"-\")\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK keeps a weak reference to the delegate. Use an object that lives as long as the app, such as the app delegate, or keep a strong reference to it yourself.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Delegate-Methods","text":"Delegate Methods"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All methods of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshInApp\/documentation\/PushwooshInApp\/PWInAppMessageDelegate","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" are optional and are called on the main thread:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Method"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppShouldDisplay(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called right before a message is shown. Return "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to drop this message. It is discarded, not postponed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppWillPresent(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called right before the message appears"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppDidPresent(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called once the message is on screen"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pushwooshInAppDidClose(messageId:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Called after the message is closed"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppClickedAction(url:messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Called when the user taps an element with a URL action, before the SDK opens the URL","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppRewardRevealed(promoCode:messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scratch card and spin wheel: the game is over and the prize is on screen. "},{"code":"promoCode","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the revealed code, if the prize has one"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"pushwooshInAppRewardClaimed(promoCode:messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Scratch card and spin wheel: the user copied the revealed promo code","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"messageId"},{"type":"text","text":" is the code of the in-app resource for campaign messages and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inAppId"},{"type":"text","text":" of the config for messages shown with "},{"code":"present(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A button that only closes the message is not a click: it triggers ","type":"text"},{"code":"pushwooshInAppDidClose(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 3: Trigger an In-App","type":"heading","anchor":"Step-3-Trigger-an-In-App"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In-app campaigns are shown on the triggers set up in the Control Panel. For an event trigger, post the event from the app:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Pushwoosh.configure.postEvent(\"PurchaseCompleted\", withAttributes: [\"amount\": 25])"]},{"anchor":"Dark-Appearance","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Dark Appearance"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When a campaign has a dark variant, the SDK uses it if the Rich Media color scheme resolves to dark. Native in-app messages and Rich Media share this setting:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Pushwoosh.media.setRichMediaColorScheme(.system)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A campaign without a dark variant always uses its light design."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Testing","text":"Testing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build and run your app with PushwooshInApp linked"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Trigger an in-app campaign that uses a native template, for example by posting its event","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify the message appears and the delegate receives "},{"code":"pushwooshInAppWillPresent(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"pushwooshInAppDidPresent(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tap a button with a link and verify "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pushwooshInAppClickedAction(url:messageId:)"},{"text":" is called","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Close the message and verify "},{"code":"pushwooshInAppDidClose(messageId:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is called"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a message does not appear, check the SDK log. A conf